XEUS encoder reimplementation
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

flaime_serving/vendored/xeus_standalone.py and flaime_serving/vendored/
xeus_model.py contain a standalone reimplementation of the XEUS encoder
architecture, written against ESPnet's XEUS SSL model in order to remove the
ESPnet runtime dependency.

  XEUS       arXiv:2407.00837 — https://huggingface.co/espnet/xeus
  ESPnet     https://github.com/espnet/espnet — Apache License, Version 2.0

The XEUS *model weights* are distributed separately by their authors under
CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 and are NOT included in this repository. This repository ships
code only; no model weights are committed. See "Model licensing" in README.md
for the terms that attach to checkpoints this code loads.

